p>\n<ul><li>Publication catalogue record: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://publications.gc.ca/pub?id=9.880827&amp;sl=0\">https://publications.gc.ca/pub?id=9.880827&amp;sl=0</a></li>\n<li>Publication catalogue number: D12-19/1E-PDF</li>\n<li>Issue direct link (pdf): <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://publications.gc.ca/collections/collection_2015/mdn-dnd/D12-19-8-3-eng.pdf\">https://publications.gc.ca/collections/collection_2015/mdn-dnd/D12-19-8-3-eng.pdf</a></li></ul>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"Royal Canadian Navy. Published by King's Printer (Ottawa)","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"92078559":{"pageid":92078559,"ns":6,"title":"File:The naval airship and the revolution at sea (IA thenavalirshipnd1094534936).pdf","index":5,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":5513117,"width":1275,"height":1650,"pagecount":148,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/The_naval_airship_and_the_revolution_at_sea_%28IA_thenavalirshipnd1094534936%29.pdf/page1-960px-The_naval_airship_and_the_revolution_at_sea_%28IA_thenavalirshipnd1094534936%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":1600,"thumbheight":2071,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/The_naval_airship_and_the_revolution_at_sea_%28IA_thenavalirshipnd1094534936%29.pdf/page1-960px-The_naval_airship_and_the_revolution_at_sea_%28IA_thenavalirshipnd1094534936%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1600,"height":2071},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b1/The_naval_airship_and_the_revolution_at_sea_%28IA_thenavalirshipnd1094534936%29.pdf?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_naval_airship_and_the_revolution_at_sea_(IA_thenavalirshipnd1094534936).pdf","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/page/92078559","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2020-07-10 06:48:44","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"<div class=\"fn\">\nThe naval airship and the revolution at sea</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"PD US Government|FEDLINK - United States Federal Collection|Academic theses and dissertations of the Naval Postgraduate School|Documents from the US Naval Postgraduate School Library|Scans from the Internet Archive/unverified|CC-PD-Mark|Scans from the Internet Archive|Books uploaded by F\u00e6|Books without Wikidata item","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Artist":{"value":"<div class=\"fn value\">\nShelby, James Richard</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<p>A system is proposed to combine an airship based fire control system (using-off-the-shelf hardware) with surface ship launched SAMs (NTUSM-2-ER) to provide OTH wide area ASCM defense for convoys and surface battle groups currently without organic airborne AAW assets. The effectiveness of surface ship AAW area defense is compared, both with and without the airship system, against low-flying ASCMs. The proposed airship system is based on combining the F-14 fire control system (AWG-9) with extrapolations from the current DARPA sponsored design for an operational development model airship (ODM). The impact on the required airship size for obtaining a given level of performance from the airshipsurface ship team is examined by varying the number of fire control units (AWG-9s) carried by the airship from 2 to 12. Costs of the proposed system are estimated. Scenarios are developed for convoy missions in a low to moderate ASCM threat environment and for surface battle group operations in a high threat (60, closely spaced ASCMs) environment.\n</p>\n<br>Subjects: Operations research; Airships; Cruise missiles.; Airship; Blimp; Lighter-than Air; SLAT Missile; Anti-ship Cruise Missile (ASCM); Over-the-Horizon Targeting</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<dl><dd><a href=\"//archive.org/details/thenavalirshipnd1094534936\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"iarchive:thenavalirshipnd1094534936\"><bdi class=\"description en\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Internet Archive identifier:</bdi> thenavalirshipnd1094534936</a></dd>\n<dd><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.org/download/thenavalirshipnd1094534936/thenavalirshipnd1094534936.pdf\">https://archive.org/download/thenavalirshipnd1094534936/thenavalirshipnd1094534936.pdf</a></dd></dl>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"This publication is a work of the U.S. Government as defined in Title 17, United States Code, Section 101. As such, it is in the public domain, and under the provisions of Title 17, United States Code, Section 105, may not be copyrighted.","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"70794510":{"pageid":70794510,"ns":6,"title":"File:\u201cThe Convoy Brook\u201d artwork by Adolf Dehn, showing U.S. Navy blimps and a ship convoy (19579256022).jpg","index":3,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":3891846,"width":3275,"height":2172,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/%E2%80%9CThe_Convoy_Brook%E2%80%9D_artwork_by_Adolf_Dehn%2C_showing_U.S._Navy_blimps_and_a_ship_convoy_%2819579256022%29.jpg/1920px-%E2%80%9CThe_Convoy_Brook%E2%80%9D_artwork_by_Adolf_Dehn%2C_showing_U.S._Navy_blimps_and_a_ship_convoy_%2819579256022%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":1600,"thumbheight":1061,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/44/%E2%80%9CThe_Convoy_Brook%E2%80%9D_artwork_by_Adolf_Dehn%2C_showing_U.S._Navy_blimps_and_a_ship_convoy_%2819579256022%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/%E2%80%9CThe_Convoy_Brook%E2%80%9D_artwork_by_Adolf_Dehn%2C_showing_U.S._Navy_blimps_and_a_ship_convoy_%2819579256022%29.jpg/1920px-%E2%80%9CThe_Convoy_Brook%E2%80%9D_artwork_by_Adolf_Dehn%2C_showing_U.S._Navy_blimps_and_a_ship_convoy_%2819579256022%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1600,"height":1061,"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/44/%E2%80%9CThe_Convoy_Brook%E2%80%9D_artwork_by_Adolf_Dehn%2C_showing_U.S._Navy_blimps_and_a_ship_convoy_%2819579256022%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/44/%E2%80%9CThe_Convoy_Brook%E2%80%9D_artwork_by_Adolf_Dehn%2C_showing_U.S._Navy_blimps_and_a_ship_convoy_%2819579256022%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E2%80%9CThe_Convoy_Brook%E2%80%9D_artwork_by_Adolf_Dehn,_showing_U.S._Navy_blimps_and_a_ship_convoy_(19579256022).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/page/70794510","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2018-07-12 21:11:46","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"\u201cThe Convoy Brook\u201d artwork by Adolf Dehn, showing U.S. Navy blimps and a ship convoy (19579256022)","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"United States Navy|PD US Navy|CC-PD-Mark|Flickr images reviewed by FlickreviewR 2|Images uploaded by Hi\u00e0n|Photographs from the U.S. Navy Museum|USGov images uploaded by Hi\u00e0n","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Lot 3124-7: Paintings of Naval Aviation during World War II:  Abbott Collection.   #59:  \u201cThe Convoy Brook\u201d Artwork by Adolf Dehn.  \u201cLike maternal hens, U.S. Navy blimps hover over a sea-borne convoy alert to any danger on the horizon or beneath the surface.  Airships are capable of speeds of 60 knots or more, yet can ride indefinitely over danger spots.  Their cargo of depth bombs make them a deadly danger to the submarine.  As convoy escorts, the lighter-than-air branch of the Navy has played its part in reopening coastal shipping lanes.\u201d  (7/10/2015).","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2015-07-10 09:08","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127906254@N06/19579256022/\">Lot 3124-7</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/127906254@N06\">National Museum of the U.S. Navy</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]}}}}